pack.name=Storage Network - Resource Pack
pack.description=A storage network addon for personal use v0.8.6

wh.addon_name=Storage Network

item.wh:wrench.desc.1=§7Shift+right-click to use
item.wh:wrench.desc.2=§7Using it on a controller starts network editing mode.
item.wh:wrench.desc.3=§7Using it in the air switches the edit mode.

item.wh:speed_kit.desc.summary=§7§oLets the controller transfer more items at once
item.wh:speed_kit.desc.withdraw=§7Withdraw: §r
item.wh:speed_kit.desc.deposit=§7Deposit: §r
item.wh:speed_kit.desc.internal=§7Internal: §r

item.wh:cycle_kit.desc.summary=§7§oLets the controller run its processing cycle more often.
item.wh:cycle_kit.desc.interval=§7Cycle interval: §r

item.wh:range_kit.desc.summary=§7§oLets the controller connect storages/terminals from farther away.
item.wh:range_kit.desc.range=§7Range: §r

item.wh:remote_access_kit.desc.summary=§7§oLets you use a remote delivery terminal farther away from its linked controller.
item.wh:remote_access_kit.desc.range=§7Usable distance: §r

item.wh:controller.desc.1=§7§oA controller for building a warehouse network.

item.wh:terminal.desc.1=§7§oA terminal for moving items between a storage and the network.
item.wh:auto_terminal.desc.1=§7§oA terminal that periodically exchanges items with the network so the storage's contents approach a target.
item.wh:inventory_terminal.desc.1=§7§oA terminal that periodically exchanges items with storage so the network's stock approaches a target.
item.wh:precision_terminal.desc.1=§7§oA terminal that maintains a target item in a specific slot of the storage, and can collect the contents of any other slot.
item.wh:delivery_terminal.desc.1=§7§oWhen a withdrawal is delivered, it goes straight into the ordering player's inventory. If offline, it goes to the storage instead.
item.wh:io_pad.desc.1=§7§oA pad that periodically exchanges items with the network to keep a player standing on it at a target amount.
item.wh:io_pad.desc.usage=§7Connect it to a network and stand on it to use it.
item.wh:suction_pad.desc.1=§7§oA pad that periodically picks up items dropped near its top and deposits them into the network.
item.wh:suction_pad.desc.usage=§7Just connect it to a network to use it (no configuration needed).
item.wh:liquid_pump.desc.1=§7§oA pump that draws liquid from the water/lava source block or full cauldron behind the face it's mounted on, converts it into a bucket, and deposits it into the network.
item.wh:liquid_pump.desc.usage=§7Just connect it to a network to use it (no configuration needed). Requires empty buckets in stock to draw liquid.
item.wh:terminal_family.desc.usage=§7Place it on a storage and connect it to a network to use it.

item.wh:remote_delivery_terminal.desc.1=§7§oA terminal that, once linked to a controller, lets you withdraw items just like a delivery terminal from a distance, and deposit items from your own inventory into the network.
item.wh:remote_delivery_terminal.desc.usage=§7Use it on a controller to link it, then use it in the air near the controller (up to 32 blocks without upgrades).

item.wh:network_observer.desc.1=§7§oOutputs a redstone signal based on the network's item counts.
